  "\n<div class=\"content-section\">\n<section class=\"video-support\" data-video=\"oa6rvUJlg7o\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-242\">Action potential recap 1</h3>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-243\">As you watch: Track which ion moves, which direction it moves, and what happens to the inside voltage.</p>\n<div data-video-slot=\"\">\n</div>\n<button type=\"button\" data-load-video=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-244\">Load video</button> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oa6rvUJlg7o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-245\">Watch on YouTube</a>\n<p class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-246\">Video not playing? Use the written explanation on this page.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"video-support\" data-video=\"_0PFBI5K9s4\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-247\">Action potential recap 2</h3>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-248\">As you watch: Explain the resting state, depolarization, repolarization and recovery in order.</p>\n<div data-video-slot=\"\">\n</div>\n<button type=\"button\" data-load-video=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-249\">Load video</button> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_0PFBI5K9s4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-250\">Watch on YouTube</a>\n<p class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-251\">Video not playing? Use the written explanation on this page.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"video-support\" data-video=\"vzA3pQB25Xk\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-252\">Action potential recap 3</h3>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-253\">As you watch: Match the membrane events with the rising, falling and undershoot regions of a voltage graph.</p>\n<div data-video-slot=\"\">\n</div>\n<button type=\"button\" data-load-video=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-254\">Load video</button> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vzA3pQB25Xk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-255\">Watch on YouTube</a>\n<p class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-256\">Video not playing? Use the written explanation on this page.</p>\n</section>\n</div>\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l05-check-toggle\">Open chapter check: Action potentials</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"check-action-potentials\" data-activity-mode=\"paired\" data-required-check=\"\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-257\">Check: Action potentials</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-258\">Chapter check \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-259\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"check-action-potentials-mc\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-260\">When an action potential begins, sodium gates open, allowing Na+&nbsp;ions to cross the membrane. Now the polarity of the membrane changes to</h3>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-261\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-action-potentials-mc\" value=\"QUES_51676_82712_A275482\" data-answer=\"\"> neutral outside and positive inside.</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-262\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-action-potentials-mc\" value=\"QUES_51676_82712_A275483\" data-answer=\"\"> positive outside and negative inside.</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-263\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-action-potentials-mc\" value=\"QUES_51676_82712_A275484\" data-answer=\"\"> negative outside and positive inside.</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-264\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-action-potentials-mc\" value=\"QUES_51676_82712_A275485\" data-answer=\"\"> there is no difference in charge between outside and inside.</label>\n<button type=\"button\" data-check=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-265\">Check answer</button>\n<p data-feedback=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-266\">\n</p>\n<fieldset class=\"paired-writing\" data-unlock=\"check-action-potentials-mc\" disabled=\"\">\n<legend>Explain the related idea</legend>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-267\">\nExplain the difference between depolarization of a neuron and an action potential. </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-268\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"18\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-269\">Textbook p. 377</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"check-action-potentials-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-270\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"check-action-potentials-written\" data-writing=\"check-action-potentials-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"check-action-potentials-written-limit check-action-potentials-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"check-action-potentials-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-271\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-272\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"check-action-potentials-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-273\">\n</p>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-run=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-274\">Submit and finish</button> <button type=\"button\" data-redo=\"\" hidden=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-275\">Redo activity</button>\n<p data-run-status=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-276\">\n</p>\n</section>\n</details>\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l05-practice-toggle\">Open optional source practice: Action potentials</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"practice-action-potentials\" data-activity-mode=\"writing\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-277\">Source practice: Action potentials</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-278\">Optional source practice \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-279\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-12\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-280\">\nDescribe the \u201call-or-none\u201d response. </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-281\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"18\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-282\">Textbook p. 377</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-12-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-283\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-12-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-12-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-12-written-limit source-checkpoint-12-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-12-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-284\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\