tten response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-14-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-14-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-14-written-limit source-checkpoint-14-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-14-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-298\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-299\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-14-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-300\">\n</p>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-run=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-301\">Submit and finish</button> <button type=\"button\" data-redo=\"\" hidden=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-302\">Redo activity</button>\n<p data-run-status=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-303\">\n</p>\n</section>\n</details>\n<div class=\"content-section\">\n<a href=\"#lesson-04\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-304\">Previous: The resting neuron</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> \u00b7 </span><a href=\"#lesson-06\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-305\">Next: Synapses &amp; summation</a>\n<p class=\"textbook-practice-lesson-link\"><a href=\"#textbook-practice\" data-textbook-topic=\"lesson-05\">Optional textbook practice for Action potentials</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</section>"
